The '''Mythological Ritual''' is an [[Event]] that occurs when {{NPCSprite|Diana}} is elected as Mayor with her {{AN|Mythological Ritual}} perk, or when {{NPCSprite|Candidate Jerry}} is elected with his {{AN|Perkpocalypse}} perk rotated to perks from Diana.

During the event, players can equip a {{Item|Griffin Pet}} and use an {{Item|Ancestral Spade}}, {{Item|Archaic Spade}}, or {{Item|Deific Spade}} to dig up [[Griffin Burrows]] in order to obtain rare items, spawn {{mt|Mythological}} creatures for rare drops, and obtain {{coins}}.

== Griffin Burrows ==
{{Main|Griffin Burrows}}
'''Griffin Burrows''' are chains of burrows found around the {{Zone|Hub}}, which can be discovered using the {{Item|Ancestral Spade}} and its upgrades' {{AN|Echo}} ability. 
