All burrows have a {{Green|75%}} chance to spawn a {{mt|Mythological}} {{DarkGreen|creature}}, and a {{Green|25%}} chance to drop a {{gold|treasure}}.

=== Burrow Treasure ===
The {{gold|treasure}} available from '''Griffin Burrows''' depends on which tier of Spade you are using to excavate them.

{{:Griffin Burrows/Item Loot}}

=== Mythological Creatures ===
Occasionally, a {{mt|Mythological}} {{DarkGreen|creature}} will spawn from a '''Griffin Burrow'''. Increasing the rarity of the player's {{Item|Griffin Pet}} will unlock {{Green|2}} mobs per tier. 

These will drop:
* ({{Item|Enchanted Ancient Claw|text=Enchanted}}) [[Ancient Claw]]s, {{Item|Enchanted Gold Ingot}}s, {{Item|Mythological Dye}};
* their signature drop;
* and, for some of them, an [[Attributes|Attribute Shard]] which can be obtained through [[Hunting]] or the usage of [[Salts]].
