The rarity of the player's {{Item|Griffin Pet}} determines the summoned mob's prefix. One can upgrade their {{Item|Griffin Pet}} using a [[File:Mythic Griffin Upgrade Stone.png|24px]] [[Griffin Upgrade Stone]] at {{NPCSprite|Kat}}.
* {{Uncommon}} → '''Blessed'''
* {{Rare}} → '''Stalwart'''
* {{Epic}} → '''Venerable'''
* {{Legendary}} → '''Exalted'''
* {{Mythic}} → '''Empyrean''' <!--peak album by john frusciante-->
