== Tracking ==
{{Main|Tracking}}

{{Stat|tracking}} is an important stat in many aspects of SkyBlock, but especially the '''Mythological Ritual''': it increases the chance of {{mt|Elusive}} mobs spawning, which includes the {{MobSprite|Minos Inquisitor}}, {{MobSprite|Sphinx}}, {{MobSprite|Manticore}}, and {{MobSprite|King Minos}}.

The following items obtained from the '''Mythological Ritual''' grant {{Stat|tracking}}:

* {{Item|Brain Food}}: {{Stat|tracking|+5}}
* {{Item|Golden Fleece}}: {{Stat|tracking|+15}} on [[Griffin Burrows]]
* {{Mythic}} {{Item|Griffin Pet}} ({{AN|Ancient Earth}}): {{Stat|tracking|+1-10}} on [[Griffin Burrows]]
* {{Item|Sphinx Shard}} ({{Attr|Mythological Tracker}}): {{Stat|tracking|+5}} on [[Griffin Burrows]]

